{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36866","headline":"春日登上元石头故城 · 罗隐","name":"春日登上元石头故城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里伤心极目春，东南王气只逡巡。\n野花相笑落满地，山鸟自惊啼傍人。\n谩道城池须险阻，可知豪杰亦埃尘。\n太平寺主惟轻薄，却把三公与贼臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}